Main.py
   ↓
Controls the application / user choices
   │
   ├── ImageReader
   │      ↓
   │   Finds images in the selected folder
   │
   ├── Imageinfo
   │      ↓
   │   Gets information about selected images
   │
   └── ImageProcessor       ← next part
          ↓
       Resize
       Rotate
       Crop

   └── ImageConverter       ← later
          ↓
       JPG → PNG
       PNG → JPG


